OL,5,G1930 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,6,     FThe BBC National Orchestra of
OL,7,     FWales and Kevin John Edusei
OL,8,     Fperform John Adams, a Tansy Davies
OL,9,     Fworld premiere with percussionist
OL,10,     FColin Currie, and Shostakovich's
OL,11,     F10th Symphony.
OL,12,G2145 Between the Ears: Miniatures
OL,13,G     (Midsummer Dreaming)
OL,14,     FAn ascent of Mount Stilwell,
OL,15,     Fchasing the last of the summer
OL,16,     Flight in Australia before it moves
OL,17,     Fto the northern hemisphere.
OL,18,G2200 Late Junction
OL,19,     FVerity Sharp presents a Midsummer
OL,20,     Fmixtape from experimental composer
OL,21,     Fand producer Iain Chambers.
